ct）存在，则它在唯一同构（isomorphism）的意义下唯一。这由米田引理（Yoneda lemma）得到，因为定义要求<MATH_0001>是<MATH_0002>的对象（object），使得\n<MATH_0003>\n对<MATH_0004>具有函子性（functorially）。换言之，积（product）<MATH_0005>是表示（representing）函子（functor）<MATH_0006>的对象（object）。\n\n", "translation_hash": "sha256:b488f99c89189148b1c452d5cdb07e3e3e7ff1e8d04a10b5b02a916e8e57d294", "unit_id": "tag:001R:prose-0001", "unknown_terms": [{"context": "一对对象的积；词表尚无批准项。", "source_term": "product", "target_term": "积"}, {"context": "积的唯一性；词表尚无批准项。", "source_term": "isomorphism", "target_term": "同构"}, {"context": "所引用引理；暂定译法。", "source_term": "Yoneda lemma", "target_term": "米田引理"}, {"context": "范畴中的对象；词表尚无批准项。", "source_term": "object", "target_term": "对象"}, {"context": "等式关于变量具有函子性；暂定译法。", "source_term": "functorially", "target_term": "函子性"}, {"context": "积表示所述函子；暂定译法。", "source_term": "representing", "target_term": "表示"}, {"context": "积所表示的函子；词表尚无批准项。", "source_term": "functor", "target_term": "函子"}]}
